// Number literals
42 => 42
1000 => 1,000
1,000,000 => 1,000,000
1_000 => 1,000
1,234.5 => 1,234.5
1.5e3 => 1,500
2.5E-3 => 0.0025
.5 => 0.5
1.5k => 1,500
2M => 2,000,000
3bn => 3,000,000,000
2 million => 2,000,000
1.5 thousand => 1,500
0xFF => 255
0b1010 => 10
0o17 => 15
½ => 0.5
1½ => 1.5
-7 => -7

// Precision
0.1 + 0.2 => 0.3
1 / 3 => 0.3333333333
2 / 3 => 0.6666666667
10 / 4 => 2.5
1e21 => 1e21
123456789 * 987654321 => 121,932,631,112,635,269
0.00000000001 => 1e-11
1 - 0.9 => 0.1
